    "body": "fix on issue/801-plasma-followups (stacked on #791) · PR #814 · pinned by sim plasma_laws::{a_rapid_over_a_freed_hole_slug_is_a_tip_up_naming_the_hole, a_rapid_leaving_a_hole_and_running_back_over_its_slug_is_a_tip_up, a_part_cut_around_an_earlier_ring_running_through_it_is_refused, a_ring_inside_an_earlier_part_touching_its_edge_is_refused}, sim plasma_program::a_rapid_over_a_freed_hole_slug_is_read_and_warned, motion plasma::tests::{a_zero_width_slit_in_a_picked_contour_is_refused_not_dropped, a_normal_sized_v_sharper_than_30_degrees_is_refused}, app plasma_gate::{an_inch_document_is_judged_the_same_and_placed_in_inches, a_g41_g42_program_is_judged_on_the_torch_centre} · merges when reviewed. Region::new zero-width slit: refused at the plasma contour door; Region::new itself is unchanged (area semantics are right for regions), so no separate issue was filed.",
